WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Jay has apologized.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.400
The statements that he made were indefensible.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.360
But I've known Jay Jones for 25 years.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.920
I think those statements were not in character.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.040
And he has apologized.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.520
I wish other people in public life

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.520
would sincerely apologize for stuff.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:16.100
So no, I still am a supporter.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.520
So the left will cancel you for posting a meme in high school

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:20.840
and then turn around and tell you

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:25.040
to elect a guy who says he wants Republicans' children to die.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.959
You know what this means, right?

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:29.840
Republicans should never have to throw any of their own

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.040
overboard ever again.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.639
These are the new rules.

00:00:33.639 --> 00:00:36.480
You can say anything and survive.

